<div id="p1" class="ltx_para"><span id="p1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\reportnumber</span>
</div>
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Dynamic Classifier-Free Diffusion Guidance via Online Feedback</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Pinelopi Papalampidi
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
