<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T2.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:113%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S5.T2.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:113%;">Automatic evaluation on LDM<math id="S5.T2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{}_{\text{large}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold">large</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}_{\text{large}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.T2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. We report alignment and visual fidelity performance via Gecko score and FID respectively for (1) gradient-based guidance that uses auxiliary models for correcting samples, (2) static CFG schedules derived from empirical observations, and (3) our dynamic CFG search when using latent alignment and/or visual quality (VQ) evaluators.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
