<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:6.0pt plus 2.0pt minus 2.0pt;"></span></p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<figure id="S5.F3.sf1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2509.16131v1/images/mona_lisa.png" id="S5.F3.sf1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:229/61;" width="229" height="61" alt="Refer to caption">
